/-!
# Poll Untrusted-Identity Branch

Proves `closure_untrusted_ok` (and `Ext`-generalized `closure_untrusted_of_kits_ext` /
`closure_untrusted_ok_ext`): when `trusted = .ok false`, Stage P1 executes `cliDpPollName` to
`s0.readReg64 .x30`, returning `.error (.untrustedIdentity y.g.peer.val)` with unchanged stores and
`decPkDef = some none`.
-/

@[expose] public section

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 200000

namespace CryptoVerification.SignalSession.Cli.RunProofs.Poll

